"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3901690","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3850090","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:58Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3850090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-3850090","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:58Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3850090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3850090","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:58Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3850090,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1844115010502482","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Balancing Card Gold Cost","summary":"Hi everyone,Upon playtester feedback, I've increased the gold cost of level 2 and level 3 cards in the card shop. I'm testing these balance changes to see how they feel. If you'd like to provide feedback on the new balance update, here's a general feedback form. https://forms.gle/LCFJGNxCvikGGou76The rationale behind the new gold costs for the cards is that, previously, it felt like the card shop was irrelevant once you got into the second half of the sewer levels and in all of the library level","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T20:38:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1843481262700452","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller Support Added","summary":"Hi everyone,I am happy to announce that controller support is now added to Coup de Koala! My game should now support DualSense, PlayStation, Xbox, Sony, Logitech, and Switch controllers (including Bluetooth).Happy playing,Victor L.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T00:50:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1842846814445324","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"update","title":"MAJOR UPDATE: New Biomes!","summary":"Hi everyone,I have some big news! After much hard work, I am proud to release two entire new biomes to the demo for Coup de Koala! These biomes are the putrid sewers and the historic castle library. So you can finally see some of the content in-game that are shown on the store page. This will allow access to players to 3 out of the 5 total planned chapters in the game for free until launch date (which will have a separate announcement next month).Besides adding in these two exciting new biomes, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T04:32:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445324","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1839676055890001","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Spruced Up Long Description with New Assets!","summary":"Hi everyone,Worked a couple hours today to spruce up the Steam store page long description with some new assets!Best,Victor L.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T04:45:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1839041357030151","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Added Steam Achievements","summary":"Patch notes in build ID 24377921Added Steam achievementsBug fixesUI/UX improvementsNerfed fire bomb by increasing the leaf cost","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T16:40:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1838407329262176","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Name Change","summary":"Hi everyone, I have changed the name of the game from Coup d'Koala to Coup de Koala. This is a very minor change but technically grammatically correct since the grammatical preposition \"d'\" from the French phrase \"coup d'etat\" is only shortened from the full spelling \"de\" when placed before a vowel. When placed before a consonant, \"de\" must be used.Best,Victor L.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-18T15:55:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329262176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1836506165555292","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Patched Minigame at the End","summary":"Demo build ID: 23904586Patched the minigame at the end (koala now can shoot and main menu button appears upon death of koala in minigame)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T21:44:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165555292","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1834602721200563","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW Difficulty Modes + Many New Cards + Bullet Fest!","summary":"TLDR:New difficulty modes: easy, normal, hard, insane, and nightmareCards now require gold to add to deck and must be purchasedMany new cards (including, but not limited to, melee parry card, melee life drain card, flaming orbitals card)Coup d'Koala is participating in Bullet Fest this week on SteamHi everyone,I am happy to announce some major additions to Coup d'Koala's gameplay! First, there are now four new difficulty modes in the game: easy, hard, insane, and nightmare. These modes have diff","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T01:47:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1832065502816196","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Coup d'Koala! (and small patches)","summary":"Hi everyone!I'd like to make an official call for playtesters for Coup d'Koala. In preparation for this call for playtesters, I've made a few minor patches to the game, but the focus of this playtest is mostly to inform me what you think should be included in the game! You can leave feedback through this two-question Google form (https://forms.gle/nm4q1J1wJgHKHMh79).Two general questions that I'm curious to hear the players' opinions on:What weapon + card synergies would you like to see in the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T20:08:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502816196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1830163047255941","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Coup d'Koala Now Available on macOS and Linux + Joining BGM Game Expo SP26!","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you all for your patience as I'm working on making Coup d'Koala as best as it possibly could be. I'm happy to announce that Coup d'Koala is now available on Windows, macOS, AND Linux!Since the last update, I've also made substantial UI/UX improvements and bug fixes. Some of the more notable features:Added a transition for bosses when they go into their second stageAdded suspense music before bossesImproved tutorial system so that now players can take their time reading critica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T20:25:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047255941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850090-1819386365101046","game_id":"steam-3850090","kind":"announcement","title":"Quality of Life and Balance Updates","summary":"Hi players! I am grateful to all those who have wishlisted my game and thank you for your support. Rest assured that I am continuing to work on this game in my spare time and hope to hav